                <Pad Id="MlHwW8F0zXzQGa1AeMcRSP" Bounds="1432,948,452,171" ShowValueBox="true" isIOBox="true" Value="Controls is a live ObservableCollection. The engine sets no dispatcher, so the follower changes the collection on a thread pool thread while the mainloop runs the patch. A change during an enumeration throws &quot;Collection was modified&quot;.&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;Spread.FromSequence copies the collection. The window for the throw goes from the whole loop, which is slow because it creates prefabs, down to the copy, which takes microseconds.">
